  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the ruins of the 'Last Sip' bar, Codec spent his early days scavenging for defunct consoles and cracked controllers. He developed a knack for hacking pre-Collapse gaming systems, a skill that proved surprisingly lucrative in the DRIP-starved Subchain City, where nostalgia could buy you almost anything.",
    "class": "Cybermancer",
    "name": "Codec",
    "personality": "Nervous and twitchy, Codec excels under pressure when his fingers fly, but otherwise is prone to anxiety and paranoia. Secretly kind-hearted, but masks it with sardonic wit and a world-weary attitude. Addicted to the digital world as an escape from the bleak reality of Subchain City.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Codec can hack into enemy drones and turrets with his cybernetic controller hands, temporarily taking control of them or disabling them entirely. The effectiveness is based on a luck roll, as the older technologies sometimes have unpredictable glitches and firewalls.",
